				1858,
				29
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Strip meta prefixes and TODO stubs from doc comments\n\nReplace \"Delegates to X module\" doc stubs on FileSystemProvider trait method\nimpls with concrete descriptions of each operation. Remove \"This struct...\",\n\"This function...\", and \"Represents...\" meta-instructional prefixes from\ndoc comments across IPC modules (Connection, Encryption, Message, Permission,\nSecurity, TauriIPCServer, ConfigurationBridge, WindAdvancedSync). Strip stale\nTODO-item stubs from MessageCompressor, SecureChannel, Compress, DefineMessage,\nEncrypt, RouteMessage, Types, LogEvent, Permission, Role, and Server modules.\n\nAdd variant-level docs to WebviewLifecycleState enum and enhanced wire-format\ndocs to UriParsing utility. Fix two DTO line continuations in\nExtensionDescriptionStateDTO and WebviewStateDTO.\n\nAlso refactor fix_rustdocs.py and rewrite_docs.py: consolidate regex patterns,\ninline get_pub_items, deduplicate split_pascal, remove unused imports, rename\nhelpers for clarity (fix_meta_instructional → fix_meta, pascal_to_verb_phrase\n→ pascal_to_verb).",
			"SHA": "33842cc9a1b2153326621c1afd245c523445c6a8"
		},
